{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorABC\/documentation\/IvorABC"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorabc\/usingivorabc"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"IvorABC"}],"title":"Using IvorABC"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorABC\/documentation\/IvorABC\/UsingIvorABC"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IvorABC exposes four processing types. Each is a "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" value type with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no-argument initializer and a single primary method:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","alignments":["left","left","left"],"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Type","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Method","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Result","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorABC\/documentation\/IvorABC\/ABCParser","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"parse(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"(ABCTunebook, [ABCParser.Diagnostic])","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorABC\/documentation\/IvorABC\/ABCNormalizer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"normalize(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"(ABCTunebook, [ABCNormalizer.Change])","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorABC\/documentation\/IvorABC\/ABCValidator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type"